<header class="page-head">
  <h1 class="page-head__title">About the prints</h1>
</header>

<div class="prose">
    <p>A collection of framed prints created over the years, inspired by film posters, music posters, book covers and more.</p>
    <p>Where possible, the designs use typefaces and imagery that complement the original subject. The collection includes a mixture of original and newly created designs. Some are based on real concerts but feature completely new artwork rather than reproductions of the original posters &mdash; including designs for Jimi Hendrix, Bob Marley and The Clash.</p>
    <p>Others include reimagined book covers, such as <em>1984</em>, as well as familiar posters given a new twist with alternative captions and artwork.</p>
    <p>All prints are produced to the same high standard using high-quality, colourfast printing. Prices vary mainly according to the quality and style of the frame.</p>
    <p>Payment can be made by bank transfer, or by cash on collection or delivery.</p>
    <p>All framed prints can be collected or delivered within the Coventry and Warwickshire area. A small additional charge applies for delivery.</p>
  <h2>Commissions</h2>
  <p>Occasionally, yes. Email with the film or record and roughly what you have in mind. Expect a few weeks rather than a few days.</p>

  <p class="prose__contact"><a class="btn btn--film" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email {{ site.email }}</a></p>
</div>
